                <td class="p-4 font-semibold">Average Typist</td>
                <td class="p-4">Standard adult speed. Basic touch typing with frequent visual glances.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-4 font-mono font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">50–69 WPM</td>
                <td class="p-4 font-mono">65th–85th Percentile</td>
