                <td class="p-4">Full touch typing; proficient keyboard buffer memory. Minimal backspacing.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-4 font-mono font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">70–89 WPM</td>
                <td class="p-4 font-mono">88th–96th Percentile</td>
                <td class="p-4 font-semibold">Fast Professional</td>
                <td class="p-4">Software engineers, court reporters, medical transcriptionists, journalists.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-4 font-mono font-bold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">90–119 WPM</td>
                <td class="p-4 font-mono">Top 2–4%</td>
                <td class="p-4 font-semibold">Master Touch Typist</td>
                <td class="p-4">Full n-gram muscle memory chunking; 98%+ sustained accuracy.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-4 font-mono font-bold text-amber-500 font-extrabold">120+ WPM</td>
                <td class="p-4 font-mono">Top 0.5%</td>
                <td class="p-4 font-semibold">Elite Competitive</td>
                <td class="p-4">World-class esports speed; sub-100ms multi-finger rolling cadences.</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
